# {{ project_name }}

{{ project_description }}

This site documents the program control plane. This page is also the
program's project hub: a links-only orientation surface. It carries no status
prose and no review date — live cross-repository status has exactly one
authority (`.beads/issues.jsonl`), and durable gates live in the root
`ROADMAP.md`. The marked Repository contract in the root `README.md` is the
sole placement authority.

- [Architecture](architecture.md) defines repository and interface boundaries.
- [Operating model](operating-model.md) defines authorities, immutable registry
  workflow, and cross-repository coordination.
- The root `ROADMAP.md` defines stable milestones and gates.
- Accepted decisions live as dated ADRs under `notes/decisions/`.
- Registered records live under `metadata/registries/`; governance checks run
  in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.
